{{! Icon tile + pixel wordmark. Params: size (tile), glyph (a lucide icon name
    to show instead of the Oxyx mark, e.g. on the 2FA step), glyphSize,
    textSize (wordmark). Wrap it in the context you need - a link in the
    sidebar, a centered row on the auth pages. }}
<span class="grid {{default size 'size-10'}} shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-md bg-grass-600 text-stone-25 shadow-[inset_0_-3px_0_rgb(0_0_0/0.3)]">{{#if glyph}}{{{icon glyph (default glyphSize 'size-5')}}}{{else}}{{> brand-mark class=(default glyphSize 'size-8')}}{{/if}}</span>
<span class="pixel {{default textSize 'text-sm'}} leading-tight text-ink">OXYX</span>
